{"id":"1f6f25b05c8c302a","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-length.md","title":"Proof Length","display":"df-proof-length — Proof Length","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-length","aliases":["72-df-proof-length"],"display":"df-proof-length — Proof Length","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-derivation-length]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; explicit node and encoding measures","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-length — Proof Length"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0712d19732fa81e7\" href=\"?note=0712d19732fa81e7\" title=\"72-df-derivation-length\">72-df-derivation-length</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; explicit node and encoding measures"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|D|\\in\\omega\">\\(|D|\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_Q:Q\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(e_Q:Q\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_R:\\{\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u):u\\in D\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(e_R:\\{\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u):u\\in D\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为本次选定的单射编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{len}(\\pi):=|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}_{e_Q,e_R}(\\pi):=\\sum_{u\\in D}(|e_Q(\\ell(u))|+|e_R(\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u))|),\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_{72}(\\pi):=\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{len}(\\pi):=|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}_{e_Q,e_R}(\\pi):=\\sum_{u\\in D}(|e_Q(\\ell(u))|+|e_R(\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u))|),\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_{72}(\\pi):=\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则编码现在读取五元对象η，不再另假定一个不受合法性约束的ρ。定义仅在存在所选有限二进制编码的语言上使用；不声称任意不可数公式集合有此编码。该len数节点，不能直接代入书中强推理数界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-derivation-length","status":"resolved","id":"0712d19732fa81e7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-derivation-length]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"|D|\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e_Q:Q\\to\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"e_R:\\{\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u):u\\in D\\}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{len}(\\pi):=|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{size}_{e_Q,e_R}(\\pi):=\\sum_{u\\in D}(|e_Q(\\ell(u))|+|e_R(\\operatorname{Rule}_\\pi(u))|),\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}_{72}(\\pi):=\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi).","display":true}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-length|df-proof-length — Proof Length]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-length|df-proof-length — Proof Length]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","0712d19732fa81e7"]}